{"asset_key":"ep3/gameplay_story_13600110","episode":"ep3","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"13600110","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1360011001:2":{"text":"戻って来たロンロンと合流したあなたたちは、荒涼の砂漠にいるブルータスを訪ねた。","source_cn":"与去而复返的满满会合后，你们一道前往荒角沙漠，去拜访布...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B823ED9C4D70FE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1360011002:0":{"text":"よく来たな、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>殿！我々の春焔武闘会へ参加するのか？","source_cn":"噢，欢迎啊，<style=stress><player...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x57A6EEB136634AFF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"よく来たな、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>殿！我々の春焔武闘会へ参加するのか？","female":"よく来たな、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>殿！我々の春焔武闘会へ参加するのか？","variant_male_record_index":"151391","variant_female_record_index":"151392","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1360011003:0":{"text":"……春焔武闘会？春焔の祝いにちなんだ大会なのですか？","source_cn":"……春焰比武？是春焰庆的比武吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51152131D9E611D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1360011004:0":{"text":"ああ、そうだ。春焔の間、各地から選び抜かれた強者たちが、リングで思う存分競い合うのだよ。","source_cn":"没错，在春焰庆期间，我们会选拔出各路好手，在擂台上尽情比斗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30ED6086C19F35B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1360011005:0":{"text":"ダミアンさんの言うとおりですね。どこも怪獣に扮するのに、ババリアだけは仮装をしないって